    "body": "# Design Proposal for Mini-Website (TES-24)

This document outlines the proposed layout and color palette for the new mini-website.

## Color Palette

The color palette is designed to be modern, clean, and trustworthy.

| Color Role      | Hex Code  | Swatch                                                              |
| --------------- | --------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| **Primary**     | `#3B82F6` | ![#3B82F6](https://placehold.co/32x32/3B82F6/3B82F6.png) |
| **Secondary**   | `#F97316` | ![#F97316](https://placehold.co/32x32/F97316/F97316.png) |
| **Text**        | `#111827` | ![#111827](https://placehold.co/32x32/111827/111827.png) |
| **Subtle Text** | `#6B7280` | ![#6B7280](https://placehold.co/32x32/6B7280/6B7280.png) |
| **Background**  | `#FFFFFF` | ![#FFFFFF](https://placehold.co/32x32/FFFFFF/FFFFFF.png) |
| **Section Bg**  | `#F3F4F6` | ![#F3F4F6](https://placehold.co/32x32/F3F4F6/F3F4F6.png) |

## Layout

A simple, single-page scrolling layout is proposed for ease of navigation. The website will be structured with the following sections:

1.  **Header:**
    *   Sticky header containing the company logo on the left.
    *   Navigation links (e.g., "Features", "About", "Contact") on the right.

2.  **Hero Section:**
    *   A prominent headline and a short, compelling tagline.
    *   A primary call-to-action (CTA) button using the secondary color.
    *   A high-quality background image or illustration.

3.  **Features Section:**
    *   A grid-based layout (e.g., 3 columns) to showcase key features.
    *   Each feature will have an icon, a short title, and a brief description.
    *   This section will use the light gray background color (`#F3F4F6`).

4.  **About Section:**
    *   A concise section to introduce the company, product, or team.
    *   Can include a team photo or a relevant graphic.

5.  **Call to Action (CTA) Section:**
    *   A clear and direct call to action.
    *   A large CTA button.
    *   This section will use the primary color as a background to make it stand out.

6.  **Footer:**
    *   A simple footer with copyright information, links to privacy policy/terms, and social media icons.
    *   It will have a dark background using the "Text" color.
"
